  "application_type_full": "Householder planning permission",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Due to its siting, depth, and overall scale, the proposed development would appear overbearing and unneighbourly when viewed from the nearest principal habitable opening at the adjoining property, No. 67 Sheephouse. As a result, it would cause unacceptable harm to the residential amenities enjoyed by the occupants of No. 67. Furthermore, the proposal would have an adverse impact on the outlook from this principal habitable window.  As such, the proposal is therefore contrary to policy D3 of the London Plan 2021 and policy DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012."
